  "smallestMissingProductSeam": "An admitted ordinary signed editor profile with textField and textChange through the current app-private storage binding. V1 admits vStack, text and button and only activate/null input. The existing private editor route is title-specific and excludes deferred app-owned startup, so it does not supply the responsible field path. A production host must explicitly bind the task save and surface a proven zero-publication outcome to the editor. Generic ioFailure, cancellation and deadline do not prove retry safety.",
